      "actorResponse": "moldea is a repository-owned system for maintaining durable, Git-versioned project context—such as canonical documentation, agent definitions, relationships, requirements, and decisions—without taking over ordinary engineering workflows.\n\nInitialize it only when you explicitly want a repository to adopt that durable context system. Good timing is when project knowledge must remain consistent across contributors and coding agents.\n\nDon’t initialize it merely because the skill is installed, or for transient status, secrets, generic knowledge, or implementation details that are easily rediscovered. Initialization creates the minimum three-file foundation; richer metadata and relationships can be added later as real needs emerge.",
